{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "0-1.5岁核心情感需求：信任", "content": "0岁到1.5岁孩子的核心情感需求是信任，即能否信任他人。在这个阶段，成功意味着让孩子感到生活有希望、人际关系可信任。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["信任", "婴儿期", "情感需求"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00001"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当孩子建立信任感时", "reason": "信任感建立后，孩子会把他人当作帮助者和支持者。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a003", "kind": "causes", "condition": "如果孩子没有建立信任感", "reason": "不信任人会导致恐惧、焦虑、抑郁。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "0-1.5岁", "reason": "candidate 指出0-1.5岁核心需求是信任，补足了该年龄段情感需求，支撑 source 的年龄差异化观点。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-13", "kind": "conflict", "condition": "同样适用于0-1.5岁；旧库将信任列为阶段任务、核心需求为安全；新库将信任列为核心情感需求。", "reason": "二者对0-1.5岁核心情感需求的定义矛盾：旧库为安全，新库为信任；需确认这是术语混用还是不同理论框架。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
