{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "满足0-1.5岁情感需求的方法：供给", "content": "满足0-1.5岁孩子情感需求的第二点是供给，包括身体上和心理上的供给。身体上：饿了有吃的，冷了有穿的，困了有睡的，尿布满了有换的。心理上：孩子哭了有人抱，笑了有人一起笑，哭时可以在温暖的怀里，高兴时有人同乐。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["供给", "身体需求", "心理需求"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "0-1.5岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足0-1.5岁需求的供给方法，包括身体和心理供给，补足了具体操作。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
