{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "0-1.5岁未获得安全感的后果", "content": "如果孩子在0-1.5岁没有获得安全感，不认为可以信任别人，以后会对亲密关系不感兴趣，婚姻出现很大问题，会出轨。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["安全感", "亲密关系", "出轨"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["原文将早期安全感缺失与出轨直接关联，属于简化归因，需核验"], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a011", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "习惯性出轨案例", "reason": "习惯性出轨案例是未获得安全感后果的例子。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a012", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "年轻人不谈恋爱", "reason": "年轻人不谈恋爱是未获得安全感后果的例子。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
