{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "年轻人不谈恋爱的原因", "content": "今天很多年轻人不想谈恋爱，只想搞钱或有朋友一起玩，但坚决不谈恋爱。原因可能是小时候父母忙着挣钱，把孩子扔给保姆，孩子没有获得可以相信别人的环境，导致对人第一不信任，第二对关系不感兴趣。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["不谈恋爱", "信任", "保姆"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["原文将年轻人不谈恋爱归因于早期保姆照顾，属于推测，需核验"], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00007", "b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "1.5-3岁核心情感需求：独立", "content": "1.5岁到3岁是一个人独立或自我怀疑的时期，核心问题是'我可以独立吗？我是一个具备独立能力的人吗？'", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["独立", "自我怀疑", "情感需求"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a015", "kind": "causes", "condition": "如果独立阶段成功", "reason": "成功会让孩子意志坚强、自信。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a016", "kind": "causes", "condition": "如果独立阶段失败", "reason": "失败会导致自我怀疑、依赖、缺乏自信。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a022", "kind": "causes", "condition": "如果情感需求未满足", "reason": "未满足会导致自卑、不自信、害怕新鲜事物。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a014", "kind": "supports", "condition": "发展身体技能和控制感", "reason": "独立阶段孩子发展身体技能和控制感。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 指出1.5-3岁核心需求是独立，补足了该年龄阶段情感需求，体现年龄匹配。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
