{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "独立阶段成功的结果", "content": "如果这个阶段成功，孩子将来会成为一个意志坚强的人。如果孩子感觉到被鼓励、被支持，他们将对自己在这个世界上的生存能力变得更有自信，觉得更加安全。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["意志坚强", "自信", "独立"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "独立阶段失败的结果", "content": "如果孩子在这个阶段没有建立独立，会成为一个自我怀疑的人。受到过于严苛的批评、过度控制，或没有机会做该年龄要做的事情（如自言自语被父母打断），孩子会开始感觉自己的生存能力不够，变得过度依赖他人，缺乏自信心，经常为自己感到羞耻，并深深怀疑自己的能力。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["自我怀疑", "依赖", "缺乏自信"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "1.5-3岁核心情感需求：被听见", "content": "1.5-3岁阶段的核心情感需求是被听见。孩子需要被人听见，因为他是独立的个体，独立的声音应该被听见。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["被听见", "情感需求", "独立"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a018", "kind": "supports", "condition": "成为孩子情绪的依靠", "reason": "被听见的需求通过成为情绪依靠来满足。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a020", "kind": "supports", "condition": "放手让孩子自己做", "reason": "放手让孩子自己做意味着信任，满足被听见的需求。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a021", "kind": "supports", "condition": "不要急着纠正", "reason": "不要急着纠正让孩子感到被听见。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "source 强调年龄匹配；candidate 明确1.5-3岁核心需求是被听见，补足了具体年龄的情感需求。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-13", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：1.5-3岁核心情感需求。", "reason": "两者均认为1.5-3岁核心情感需求是被听见。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "满足1.5-3岁情感需求的方法：成为孩子情绪的依靠", "content": "满足1.5-3岁孩子情感需求的第一点是成为孩子情绪的依靠。成为情绪依靠表示无论孩子有什么情绪、以什么方式表达，父母都是稳定的、安全的，并能给予支持、帮助和handle。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["情绪依靠", "支持", "稳定"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a019", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "探测能否成为情绪依靠", "reason": "三个问题用于探测能否成为孩子情绪的依靠，是成为情绪依靠方法的具体步骤，原方向反了，应为三个问题作为方法的步骤。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向反了。"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足1.5-3岁需求的方法：成为孩子情绪的依靠，补足了具体满足方式。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0019"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "question", "title": "探测能否成为孩子情绪依靠的三个问题", "content": "三个问题探测能否成为孩子情绪的依靠：1. 孩子哭的时候，你的第一个反应是什么？（很多父母第一反应是'又来了'）2. 孩子尖叫的时候，你的第一反应是什么？（可能也不是什么好的反应）3. 当孩子害怕、不敢尝试时，你的第一反应是什么？（可能是气愤、厌恶、恨铁不成钢）", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["情绪依靠", "自我反思", "问题"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a019", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "满足1.5-3岁情感需求的方法：放手让孩子自己做", "content": "满足1.5-3岁孩子情感需求的第二点是放手让孩子自己去做，因为这意味着对孩子的信任。即使眼睁睁看着孩子把裤子穿反，也允许他自己做，然后发现穿反了再自己改过来。不要一直包着尿布不让他独立上厕所，要让他做那些想做但可能会做错的事情。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["放手", "信任", "独立"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00014", "b00015"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足1.5-3岁独立需求的方法：放手让孩子自己做，补足了具体满足方式。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0021"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "满足1.5-3岁情感需求的方法：不要急着纠正", "content": "满足1.5-3岁孩子情感需求的第三点是不要急着纠正孩子，特别是无关紧要的事情。在这个阶段要选择你的battle，如果每件事都管都说，会累死自己，因为孩子每隔五分钟大概率就在做不应该做的事情。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["纠正", "选择", "放手"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a021", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足1.5-3岁需求的方法：不要急着纠正，补足了具体满足方式。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0022"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "1.5-3岁情感需求未满足的后果", "content": "如果不能满足孩子在这个时期的情感需要，孩子会变得非常自卑、不自信，害怕新鲜事物。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["自卑", "不自信", "害怕新鲜事物"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a022", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁需求未满足时", "reason": "candidate 说明未满足1.5-3岁需求的后果（自卑不自信），反证了 source 年龄匹配的重要性。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0023"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "question", "title": "父母关于孩子胆小的常见问题", "content": "很多父母问：孩子什么都怕，不愿意尝试新事物，怎样让孩子变得更勇敢？讲师认为问题不是如何让孩子勇敢，而是父母如何成为可以培养出勇敢孩子的父母。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["胆小", "勇敢", "父母角色"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a023", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a024", "kind": "supports", "condition": "父母希望具体步骤", "reason": "讲师批评父母期望具体步骤，认为这是悲哀。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "孩子胆小不勇敢时", "reason": "candidate 提出父母关于孩子胆小的常见问题，与 source 年龄匹配相关，但未直接补充核心需求，仅通过问题关联。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0024"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "讲师对父母期望的批评", "content": "很多父母喜欢听具体步骤（第一、第二、第三），甚至希望讲师直接帮他们培养孩子，但讲师认为这是父母的悲哀。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["父母期望", "教育方法"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a024", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0025"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "principle", "title": "错的时间给对的情感需求仍是错的", "content": "孩子在不同年龄有不同的核心情感需求，父母角色也应相应调整。如果在错误的时间给予对的情感需求，仍然是无效的，教育必须匹配年龄阶段。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["情感需求", "年龄匹配", "父母角色"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:v2-n001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-04492c118b9b", "blocks": ["b00001"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "relations": [{"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a004", "kind": "complements", "condition": "0-1.5岁", "reason": "source 强调不同年龄不同核心情感需求；candidate 明确0-1.5岁核心需求是安全，补足了具体年龄的情感需求。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a017", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "source 强调年龄匹配；candidate 明确1.5-3岁核心需求是被听见，补足了具体年龄的情感需求。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "0-1.5岁", "reason": "candidate 指出0-1.5岁核心需求是信任，补足了该年龄段情感需求，支撑 source 的年龄差异化观点。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a007", "kind": "complements", "condition": "0-1.5岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足0-1.5岁安全/信任需求的方法：安全的家庭环境，补足了如何满足该年龄需求。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a005", "kind": "complements", "condition": "0-1.5岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足0-1.5岁需求的方法：高质量陪伴，补足了具体满足方式。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a013", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 指出1.5-3岁核心需求是独立，补足了该年龄阶段情感需求，体现年龄匹配。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a022", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁需求未满足时", "reason": "candidate 说明未满足1.5-3岁需求的后果（自卑不自信），反证了 source 年龄匹配的重要性。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a021", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足1.5-3岁需求的方法：不要急着纠正，补足了具体满足方式。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a018", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足1.5-3岁需求的方法：成为孩子情绪的依靠，补足了具体满足方式。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a006", "kind": "complements", "condition": "0-1.5岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足0-1.5岁需求的供给方法，包括身体和心理供给，补足了具体操作。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a020", "kind": "complements", "condition": "1.5-3岁", "reason": "candidate 提供满足1.5-3岁独立需求的方法：放手让孩子自己做，补足了具体满足方式。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-04492c118b9b-c001:a023", "kind": "association", "condition": "孩子胆小不勇敢时", "reason": "candidate 提出父母关于孩子胆小的常见问题，与 source 年龄匹配相关，但未直接补充核心需求，仅通过问题关联。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-13", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：不同年龄核心需求错配时；旧库提供清单，新库强调时机匹配。", "reason": "新库补充了在错误的时间给对的情感需求仍无效的原则，支持旧库按年龄区分核心需求。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-14", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "均适用于父母给予的情感需求与孩子年龄不匹配的场景；候选未显式给出旧有条件，但内容一致。", "reason": "该候选直接表达'错的时间给对的情感需求仍是错的'，与旧原子核心主张一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-16", "kind": "complements", "condition": "均适用于年龄匹配原则；候选更宽泛地指情感需求时间匹配。", "reason": "候选从情感需求时间匹配的角度支持旧原子爱的语言年龄匹配原则。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-r-07", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：按年龄给予匹配的需求；旧原子讲期望匹配发展阶段", "reason": "候选说明不同年龄有不同的核心情感需求，错误时间给对需求无效，补充旧原子年龄匹配原则。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "knowledge_units": ["s-04492c118b9b-c001:u0001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "alternate_titles": []}
